body: "# 2026-05-08 — Tantivy/Context-Mode Master Plan Wave (Session Report)\n\n> **Status**: COMPLETE — 15/15 initiatives delivered + cross-audit + 4 orphans wired\n> **Skill version**: v4.31.0 → v4.32.0\n> **Schema version**: v3 → v5 (TantivyIndex + ToolOutputsIndex)\n> **Tests**: 3409 baseline → 3479 final (+70 net delta, 0 fails)\n> **Source plan**: ~/.claude/plans/2026-05-08-touring-master-plan.md (1518L, 62KB)\n> **Plan generator**: ~/.claude/scripts/generate_touring_master_plan.py (data-driven Python, stdlib-only, ~1500 LOC)\n\n## TL;DR\n\nSingle-session full delivery of the 15-initiative master plan derived from the cross-audit comparison of Touring (Tantivy 0.22) vs context-mode (SQLite FTS5). After execution, Touring becomes a superset of context-mode: every feature in parity + 6 features only Tantivy enables (JSON fields, aggregations, facets, custom tokenizer pipelines, BM25 field-boost, SnippetGenerator).\n\nFinal test counts:\n- 3447 lib (cargo test -p touring-hooks --lib)\n- 16 tests/context_mode_e2e.rs (D2/D2.2/D2.3/D3/D6/P3-TRIG audits)\n- 16 tests/master_plan_e2e.rs (15 per-initiative + 1 full pipeline)\n- Total: 3479 PASS, 0 fails, 0 TODO/FIXME/dead_code residual\n\n## 15 Initiatives outcome\n\nI-01 NgramTokenizer trigram REAL + 3-way RRF (S1, T1, M)\nI-02 PhraseQuery proximity boost slop=2 (S1, T1, S)\nI-03 5x heading boost via field_boosts (S1, T1, S)\nI-04 SnippetGenerator + strip_html_tags (S2, T1, M)\nI-05 TTL cache 24h + cleanup_expired 14d (S1, T1, S)\nI-06 JSON field tool_args + serde_to_owned helper (S2, T2, M)\nI-07 aggregate_terms + ctx_aggregate MCP (S3, T2, M)\nI-08 FacetCollector + ctx_facets MCP (S3, T2, M)\nI-09 DateField dual-write stored_at_dt (S2, T2, S)\nI-10 Progressive throttling 3-tier (NEW module throttle.rs, S4, T2, M)\nI-11 Multi-lang sandbox 11 runtimes (S4, T3, L)\nI-12 Credential whitelist 25 envs + redact_secrets (S4, T3, M)\nI-13 26 lifecycle events 5-tier classify_priority (S5, T3, L)\nI-14 Think-in-Code threshold 10 -> 5 env-tunavel (S5, T3, M)\nI-15 SessionGuide 15-section builder (NEW module session_guide.rs, S5, T3, M)\n\n## Cross-audit findings + REGRA #0\n\n4 orphan APIs detected and wired into MCP surface:\n- count_facets -> ctx_facets\n- aggregate_terms -> ctx_aggregate\n- cleanup_expired -> ctx_cleanup\n- get_tool_output_with_snippet -> ctx_retrieve_with_query\n\nMCP ctx_* tool count: 5 (D6 baseline) -> 9 total.\n\nFinal tool registry (CTX_MCP_TOOL_NAMES): ctx_search, ctx_index, ctx_retrieve, ctx_insight, ctx_compress, ctx_session_guide, ctx_aggregate, ctx_facets, ctx_cleanup. Plus ctx_search_throttled (I-10 wraps ctx_search) and ctx_retrieve_with_query (I-04 variant of ctx_retrieve).\n\n## Tantivy schema evolution\n\nv3 baseline -> v4 (NgramTokenizer trigram + symbol_name_trigram field) -> v5 (Facet hierarchy + DateField dual-write + JSON tool_args).\n\nBackward compat: #[serde(default)] on every new ToolOutputDoc field; existing serialised docs deserialise without mutation.\n\n## Files modified\n\ntantivy_index.rs (+500 LOC, schema v3->v5), sandbox_executor.rs (+250 LOC, 11 runtimes + redactor), gate_metrics.rs (+50 LOC, 4 new counters), feature_flags.rs (+30 LOC, 9 new flags), hook_events.rs (+40 LOC, 26 hook names), pre_read.rs (+5 LOC, threshold env), cli_handlers_mcp.rs (+200 LOC, +4 MCP tools), lib.rs (+6 LOC, +2 mod), throttle.rs (NEW 200 LOC), session_guide.rs (NEW 300 LOC), tests/context_mode_e2e.rs (+10 LOC, count update), tests/master_plan_e2e.rs (NEW 380 LOC, 16 audits), ~/.claude/scripts/generate_touring_master_plan.py (NEW ~1500 LOC), ~/.claude/plans/2026-05-08-touring-master-plan.md (NEW 1518 LOC).\n\n## Validation\n\n3447 lib + 16 context_mode_e2e + 16 master_plan_e2e = 3479 tests PASS, 0 fails.\n0 TODO/FIXME/dead_code in modified files.\n0 orphan symbols among new pub APIs.\nPlan generator validation: 15 initiatives, 0 warnings, 0 errors.\n\n## REGRA compliance\n\nREGRA #0 potencializar: 4 orphans wired into MCP tools (count: 4 -> 0); zero allow(dead_code) added; pre-existing parse_universal_rules / parse_categories / parse_scoring / runtime / handle_json_request_async_stored_line from prior wave already wired.\n\nREGRA #14 agentic paradigm: every .rs file created via taco-forge perfect-create --kind RustModule --content-from; no Write / heredoc / sed-i to code files. Plan generator created via taco-forge perfect-create --kind PythonScript.\n\nREGRA #11 git proibido: zero git operations performed by orchestrator; all state changes via Touring CLI + memory + RL rewards.\n\n## Memory + RL persistence\n\n8 lessons stored (tier=semantic):\n- lesson:wave:2026-05-08:context-mode-integration-complete\n- lesson:wave:2026-05-08:context-mode-cross-audit-COMPLETE\n- lesson:wave:2026-05-08:update-touring-self-healing\n- lesson:wave:2026-05-08:master-plan-generated\n- lesson:wave:2026-05-08:master-plan-execution-partial\n- lesson:wave:2026-05-08:master-plan-extended-execution\n- lesson:wave:2026-05-08:master-plan-COMPLETE-15-15\n- lesson:wave:2026-05-08:cross-audit-master-plan-COMPLETE\n\nRL rewards: orchestrate +1.0 x 8, generate +1.0 x 4, edit +1.0 x 4. EMA reward: 0.06 baseline -> 0.806. composite_health_score: 0.497 -> 0.591.\n\n## Continuation pointers\n\nNext wave candidates (from analysis but not in master plan):\n- touring tantivy aggs standalone CLI subcommand (currently MCP-only via ctx_aggregate)\n- touring sandbox <lang> <code> standalone CLI subcommand (currently via tool_name routing)\n- Schema migration v3->v5 auto-rebuild on open_or_create when version mismatch detected\n\nRelated session reports:\n- ~/.claude/rust/docs/2026-05-07-context-mode-integration-plan.md (input plan)\n- ~/.claude/rust/docs/2026-05-06-cross-audit-final.md (prior session)\n\nPlan re-generation: python3 ~/.claude/scripts/generate_touring_master_plan.py (idempotent, validates structure, regenerates plan in 1518L Markdown).\n\n## References\n\n- context-mode repo: https://github.com/mksglu/context-mode\n- context-mode landing: https://context-mode.com/\n- Think in Code blog: https://mksg.lu/blog/think-in-code\n- Claude Code limit-burn blog: https://mksg.lu/blog/claude-code-limit-burn\n- Tantivy llms.txt (context7): https://context7.com/quickwit-oss/tantivy/llms.txt\n- Tantivy GitHub: https://github.com/quickwit-oss/tantivy\n- Constitutional rules: ~/.claude/rules/TACO-subagent.md, ~/.claude/rules/touring-cli-index.md, ~/.claude/rules/taco-forge-canonical-workflows.md\n\nGenerated 2026-05-08 by TACO orchestrator (Claude Opus 4.7 1M context). Touring Daemon v30.3.0.\n"
